OL,3,GNEWSAMan's agonising search for family
OL,4,Ain flood-hit Nepal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man from East Sussex who flew to
OL,7,Fflood-hit Nepal in search of his wife,
OL,8,Fmother, brother and uncle says he still
OL,9,Fhas not been able to locate his family.
OL,11,FPramod Poudel, from Uckfield, has not
OL,12,Fheard from his relatives since flash
OL,13,Ffloods on the Nepal-Tibet border on
OL,14,FWednesday led to more than 900 deaths
OL,15,Fand more than 4,200 people missing.
OL,17,FPoudel, who arrived in Nepal last
OL,18,FFriday, said the situation has
OL,19,F"completely devastated his family" and
OL,20,Fleft him "emotionally shattered".
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
