OL,3,GNEWSAMan's agonising search for family
OL,4,Ain flood-hit Nepal
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe is currently in the town where he
OL,7,Fand his family were all born in Nepal,
OL,8,Fwhere he said major flooding has
OL,9,Faffected parts of the area, with roads
OL,10,Fand bridges severely damaged.
